BCMath: arbitrary precision mathematics, numbers of any size and
precision as strings.

The module bcmath of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/bcmath.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/bcmath.
